cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use BEEF in your research, please cite the paper below."
title: "BEEF: Bridged Engine for EME and FDTD"
abstract: >-
  A Python framework that partitions an integrated photonic device into
  sections, simulates each with whichever of eigenmode expansion (EME) or
  finite-difference time-domain (FDTD) best suits its geometry, and cascades
  the per-section responses into a simulation of the full device.
